sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 举报人/用户
    actor Admin as 管理员
    participant Platform as 交易平台
    User->>Platform: POST /api/report-block/report
    Platform-->>User: 举报提交成功
    User->>Platform: POST /api/report-block/block
    Platform-->>User: 拉黑成功
    User->>Platform: GET /block/check/{targetUserId}
    Platform-->>User: 返回拉黑状态
    User->>Platform: DELETE /block/{targetUserId}
    Platform-->>User: 解除拉黑成功
    Admin->>Platform: GET /api/admin/reports
    Platform-->>Admin: 返回举报队列
    Admin->>Platform: POST /api/admin/reports/audit
    Platform-->>Admin: 返回审核结果
    Admin->>Platform: POST /api/admin/reports/credit-adjust
    Platform-->>Admin: 返回信用调整结果
    Platform-->>Admin: 写入信用和审计日志
